  "redeem": [
    "Join Dress To Impress on Roblox and wait for the lobby or dressing room to load.",
    "Click the Codes button (the three stars icon) on the left side of the screen. It shows during intermission and dressing, not on the runway.",
    "Type the code exactly, using the numbers 0, 1, 3 and 4 where the code has them instead of letters.",
    "Press the checkmark to redeem, and the item appears in your dressing room right away."
  ],
  "notes": "Dress To Impress is a fashion game from the Dress To Impress Group. Each round gives everyone the same theme, and you get a few minutes in the dressing room to put together an outfit using clothes, hair, makeup and accessories. Then every player walks the runway, strikes a pose, and the others vote with stars. Good scores help you climb the ranks from beginner up to Top Model.\n\nCodes in this game give free clothing and accessories, and many of them come from creator collabs, so they tend to stay active for a long time. Full outfit codes like LANA, LEAHASHE and CA11MEHHALEY are the most useful because they fit lots of themes at once. New codes usually arrive with updates, holidays, visit milestones like 10 billion visits, and creator partnerships, and they are shared in the game's Discord.",
